    {
      "example": "[\"2ad1ae67295445f598017499dc****\", \"2ad1ae67295445f598017123dc****\"]",
      "help_en": "The instance IDs of the simple application servers. The value can be a JSON array that consists of up to 100 instance IDs. Separate multiple IDs with commas (,).\n\nIf you specify both `InstanceIds` and `PublicIpAddresses`, the instance IDs and public IP addresses must belong to the same simple application server. Otherwise, an empty result is returned",
